  "current_evidence_state": "Three completed local corner models, including the learned coordinate correction, have been audited. The correction returns 564/583 and 582/583 reviewed-reference pair successes at five and ten pixels, below the proposed method at both thresholds; selected CPU replay preserves its scored outcomes. Both the original supplied model and proposed method were rerun in a common CPU environment. Unchanged predictions were additionally scored against the verified original supplied 664-front annotations, which favour the original model. The manuscript distinguishes evaluation-reference sensitivity from causal training-label effects and retains the supplied original model as its benchmark.",
